WEBVTT

00:13:29.503 --> 00:13:30.963
something wrong with your partner.

00:13:30.963 --> 00:13:32.986
I think a lot of families are fractured

00:13:32.986 --> 00:13:34.971
by unrealistic expectations

00:13:34.971 --> 00:13:38.016
that are based upon this false
vision of human sexuality.

00:13:38.016 --> 00:13:39.480
That's what I'm trying to get at.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.979
CA: Thank you. Communicated
powerfully. Thanks a lot.

00:13:41.979 --> 00:13:45.970
CR: Thank you, Chris.
(Applause)